     C                   Z-ADD     WA20JDAT      WKJDAT                         JOBDATUM
     C                   Z-ADD     WA20JZEI      WKJZEI                         JOBZEIT
     C                   MOVEL(P)  WA20USER      WKUSER                         USER
     C                   MOVEL(P)  WA20PROG      WKPROG                         PROGRAMM
     C                   MOVEL(P)  WA20BIBL      WKBIBL                         BIBLIOTHEK
     C                   ENDIF
     C*-------------------------------------------------------------------------
