     C                   MOVEL(P)  DAJNAM        WA20JNAM                       ZUGRIFFELDER
     C                   MOVEL(P)  WKCHPN        WA20PROG                       MIT USERDATEN
     C                   MOVEL(P)  WKCHPL        WA20BIBL                       FÜLLEN
     C                   MOVEL(P)  DAUSER        WA20USER
     C*--------------------------------------------------------
